{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_05_end","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-5","storyName":"“致新生活”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"柳德米拉留在了卡车互助会，渐渐融入了卡车司机们的生活。车祸当晚，索默尔避开了其他司机私自出车，察觉到蹊跷的柳德米拉主动坐上了副驾驶座。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["？？？","索默尔","柳德米拉","穿红色连帽衫的人","红","外婆","狂欢节路人A","狂欢节路人B","狂欢节路人A＆B","大帝","子月","卡车司机A","卡车司机B"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"索默尔，这是怎么回事？","id":7},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我也不知道！我正开车呢，发动机出了故障，结果发现这个人就躺在路边。吓我一跳，我还以为是我撞到了人。","id":8},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"这孩子一个人晕倒在荒野上，嘴里还一直念叨着要找一个穿红色连帽衫的家伙。","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我想总不能把她扔在那，就先带她回来了......","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"找我？可我完全不认识她啊。","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"她看上去就是个孤零零的倒霉蛋，或许能留她在营地？我们最近忙成这样，补充一个人手也行啊。","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"索默尔，你明知道互助会的每一个成员都是要经过严格审查的。","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"像她这样的感染......来历不明的人，万一和家族有什么关系怎么办？","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"唉......","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"医生说她情况还算稳定，等她醒来后，就让她离开吧。","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"好，好吧。","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"这个倒霉蛋，怎么还紧紧握着刀不放，多危险啊。先给她——","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dim_openeye","layer":"1","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":23},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slap","volume":"0.5","id":24},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"别碰我！","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":29},{"type":"bgeffect","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穿红色连帽衫的人","text":"......","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穿红色连帽衫的人","text":"你醒了。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你——！","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉看着眼前的人，很用力地揉了揉眼睛。","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"对不起......这是哪里？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穿红色连帽衫的人","text":"这里是新沃尔西尼，卡车互助会。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"是你们救了我......谢谢。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穿红色连帽衫的人","text":"没什么，我们的成员不会对一个晕倒在荒野上的人见死不救。但后面的事，我们没有办法帮你太多。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穿红色连帽衫的人","text":"我们最多招待你一顿饭，之后就离开吧。索默尔，你来负责这件事。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":47},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"谢谢你们的帮助......我这就走。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"别急，年轻人。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"保险起见，我还是想问问你......你不是家族的人，对吧？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......我已经很多年没有听说过这个词了。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我也觉得，你看上去也不像和那帮人有什么往来。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"别在意，伊雷妮只是很担心家族的人会渗入互助会，她要操心的事很多，并不是对你有什么敌意。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你来到营地后的医药费，其实全都是她自掏腰包的。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"谢谢......我明白，我不会给你们添麻烦的。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我只是需要花时间想想......接下来该做什么。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你会开车吗？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"在乌萨斯开过卡车，算吗？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesbedroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":78},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":79,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"sticker","id":81,"text":"红。","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":82,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"很轻的呢喃，和声音同时出现的，是同样温柔的抚摸。","id":84},{"type":"text","text":"像是飘落在草地上的树叶，在荒野的背坡处感受到的风，没有危险。","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"她曾经在这样的呢喃和抚摸中睡去，长大。","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"在罗德岛，没有人敢对她这样，没有人会对她这样，哪怕是凯尔希。","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#7","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......是外婆？！","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_char_144_red_7.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"char","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"0.5","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":94},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆，你已经完全看不清东西了吗？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"外婆说过的，外婆的双目被狼吞吃了，这副眼镜只是摆设。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"只有剜出狼的双目，将它们重新放回外婆的眼眶，外婆才能看清红的模样。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆也没法抱抱红？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"外婆的双手被狼吞下肚，你要斩断狼的四肢，把双手还给外婆。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆也没法再教我唱歌？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"外婆也想继续教红唱歌。可狼总在嚎叫，外婆不敢惊到他们。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆，你为什么这么久才来找红？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"狼太多了，红，他们潜伏在路的两侧。你要割开狼的皮肉，用它们为外婆做一件衣衫。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"呜......","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆真的会消失吗？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"乖孩子，这就要看你能不能帮到外婆了。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红、红在龙门找到了狼，假的。但她身上有真狼的气味。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"在那以后，红还没有新的发现......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"唔，外婆，是红没有继续找。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"外婆不会怪红。红是最乖最好的孩子。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红不是。红在第一次猎狼的时候就晕倒了，红当时太弱小，凯尔希在草窠里救了红。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红暂时跟在她身边，她告诉红很多红不知道的事情。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#3","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"什么是“保护”，什么是“行凶”？什么是“痛苦”，什么是“开心”？什么是红能够分辨的，什么是红能够做到的？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_char_144_red_3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"问题很多，也很难。红想不明白。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_char_144_red_3.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"“痛苦”？“开心”？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"是外婆没有照顾好红，反而需要红来救助......","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"孩子，如果你不开心，就继续留在罗德岛。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"外婆","text":"外婆的时间本来也已经不多了。就这样忘记外婆，忘记自己是个猎狼人......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1549_1$1.png"},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#4","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_char_144_red_4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1549_1#1$1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":155},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":157},{"type":"char","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"红睁开了眼睛。","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"门和窗都还紧紧地关着，明明连一丝风都没有透进来。","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"这是她今晚第三次被同样的梦惊醒。","id":163},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","duration":"0.5","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆需要红......","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#2","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"（用力摇摇耳朵）","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_char_144_red_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红答应凯尔希，离开罗德岛，要跟她说。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"凯尔希不在，凯尔希去了特什么蒙，很远的城市。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#5","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红应该等——红不能等，外婆不能等。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_char_144_red_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":177},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"false","id":178},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":179},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#2","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"（警惕地嗅嗅）","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_char_144_red_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红闻到了狼的味道。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"剩下的真狼已经不多，剩下的真狼就在这里。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"对那些狼来说，伤害外婆只是“游戏”。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"那对红来说，游戏的规则便是杀死他们。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......外婆还在等红。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":191},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":196},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":197},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act21side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act21side/m_sys_act21side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":199,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":200},{"type":"animtext","id":201,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    3:17 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":202},{"type":"animtextclean","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1557_1#1$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.7","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂欢节路人A","text":"“为了非凡的夜晚，我要磨快利爪！”","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1557_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1556_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.7","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂欢节路人B","text":"“为了迅捷的狩猎，我要亮出尖牙！”","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1556_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"-150,0","power":"-30","times":"1","duration":"0.7","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂欢节路人A","text":"“为了自由的狂欢，我要拼命厮杀！”","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"jump","posto":"150,0","power":"-30","times":"1","duration":"0.7","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂欢节路人B","text":"“厮杀直至最后一个，游戏尽头才能到达！”","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂欢节路人A","text":"“究竟我们为何如此？”","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.05","duration":"0.5","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.05","duration":"0.5","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"160,-30","power":"-30","times":"1","duration":"0.5","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"jump","posto":"-160,-30","power":"-30","times":"1","duration":"0.5","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":231},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂欢节路人A＆B","text":"“因为我们是狼！”","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-10,-30","posto":"-200,-30","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"10,-30","posto":"-200,-30","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","duration":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"戏一般，但在街头演出的形式值得鼓励！你瞧瞧这探照灯，瞧瞧这装饰，听听这音乐......","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"是大帝？你怎么在这里？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"你不也回来了吗，小狼崽？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"这种热闹的派对，和我这样的天才艺术家刚好相配！我当然要出现在这里！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"看看，年轻人的派对比你们像样多了，阿涅塞。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"......你是来参加派对的，还是来找阿涅塞的？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"孩子，你的阿涅塞教了你这么多，就愣是没介绍过，派对正是见老朋友的好地方吗？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"-100,0","power":"-30","times":"1","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"100,0","power":"-30","times":"1","duration":"0.4","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"0.41","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"这就是大帝♪眼睛超灵敏♪朋友走遍地♪......一个不注意就要把你击毙♪这歌词怎么样？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"这就是你随便唱出来的吧......","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"即兴，即兴不就是这样吗！阿涅塞，你是不是没教过你的小朋友什么叫流行音乐啊！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"不许你说她！阿涅塞很好，她教我的歌比你唱的好听！","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"是吗？她还教了你什么？","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"阿涅塞教我的可多了！她教我生火教我找过夜的地方，教我怎么拿弓怎么用刀子，教我怎么狩猎怎么放干猎物的血！","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"怎么总是这种打打杀杀的......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"......她还教我风的方向、花的味道，教我怎么和牙兽说话。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"她还教我怎么和人类对话，教我怎么在人类之间活下去。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"看得出来，你口齿还挺利索，不像那个红色的家伙，每说半句话就能把人急死。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"阿涅塞还教我人类的狂欢节有多好玩，教我怎么在城市里也能过得开心自在，像在荒野里一样......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"......你还真是学到了不少东西。运气真好，其他的獠牙可学不到这些。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"其他的獠牙......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"我之前还遇见过其他的狼和他们的獠牙，开口第一个字就让人抓狂。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"唉，说实话，阿涅塞，要不是真有要紧的事情，我是绝对不想再和你们这些什么“狼之主”打交道了。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"虽然狼群野蛮又顽固，但这一次同族的会面，你们不能缺席。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"阿涅塞的同族......","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"“我的意愿不足以扭转整个狼群的目光......”阿涅塞，你什么意思？说好的“挣脱道路”，说好的“新的生活”呢？","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"“游戏是狼群的决议，游戏不结束，狼群的意志就不会投向别处，这是我们的天性......”怎么又扯到你们那无聊的游戏了！","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"“扭转天性是漫长的过程......”，真是够麻烦的！真不想跟你们打交道，一说到正经事就开始扯什么天性。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"阿涅塞说过，“这场游戏，必须有个赢家。”","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"真是蠢狼，我白夸你一通了！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"算了......你教了这孩子这么多厮杀之外的本领，难道还希望她和其他獠牙一样厮杀到死？当初让我送她去罗德岛，也不是为了今天吧？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"......","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"你要是担心她的安危，还是赶紧把她送回罗德岛去吧。真是的，怎么就非要到处乱跑呢！","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"罗德岛......","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":311},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wolflordthreat","volume":"1","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"0,0","power":"30","times":"1","duration":"0.3","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_105_emper","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"——哇！这些牙兽什么时候出现的，龇着大牙想要吓唬谁呢！","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"......它们很害怕，它们嗅到了獠牙的气息。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"我也嗅到了。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"狼已经来了。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":321},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":326},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":329,"musicid":3},{"type":"animtext","id":330,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    4:05 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":331},{"type":"animtextclean","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bottlecollide","volume":"1","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"哇，你拿冰过的盐汽水冰我的脸干嘛，吓我一跳！","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"你听柳德米拉讲故事听得太入迷了。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"后来呢？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"这个塔露拉，后来弑君者杀掉她了吗？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","duration":"1.5","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"没有。弑君者没有杀她。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"真可惜，明明一直跟在塔露拉身边，却始终没有察觉所谓的领袖其实是一条满嘴谎话的恶龙......本来那么多人都可以得救的。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"话说，那个弑君者既没杀塔露拉，也没杀乌萨斯皇帝，为什么给自己取名字叫“弑君者”？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"说得轻巧，那是皇帝和恶龙啊，你杀过人吗罗米？","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"不对，你不会真的杀过人吧？在给波吉亚家族干活的时候，你不会......","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"我可没干过这种事。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"我一个司机，也就帮那些人开开夜车。杀人越货这种事，是不会轻易交给我这样的人去做的。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"真的假的，你车开得这么烂，能给大人物们开夜车？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"开夜车......不会是什么我不知道的家族黑话吧？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#3$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"当然只是字面意思而已！你这家伙，口气怎么和警察一模一样！再说，那都是过去的事了。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"不过说实在的，罗米，你最近吃的罚单是有点多了。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"狂欢节嘛，人多车多，大街小巷都不太好走，你又不是不知道。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"我又没在满是废墟的移动城市里一边开车一边躲天灾过！","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"你还沉浸在柳德米拉的故事里呢？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"话说，柳德米拉，这些故事真的只是你在乌萨斯的时候听来的吗？你讲得有鼻子有眼的，好像亲身经历过一样......","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你们啊，喝人家的汽水，听人家的故事，还缠着人家问东问西，有没有点礼貌？","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"啊，怪我怪我。不好意思啊，柳德米拉。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"没事。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳德米拉，也没必要每周都是你请客吧？","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你来营地多长时间了，三个月，四个月？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"记不清了，反正挺久了。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"互助会给你发的工资，你又全还给我们这些人了。为什么不听我的，省下来将来做点小买卖呢？","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#9$1","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你们都拖家带口的，我一个人，没什么用钱的地方。再说，我一个倒霉蛋，钱说不定存着存着也就长翅膀飞了。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#7$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"话不是这么说......","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#9$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"哎呀，只是两箱盐汽水而已。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"大周末的，本来应该请大家喝点啤酒的。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不过你们今天晚上不是还要跟着去法院广场拍电影嘛，有的忙呢，只能换成口感差不多的汽水。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"没喝过瘾的话就多喝几瓶。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"那我多来两瓶——！","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"charslot","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_56_i07.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","screenadapt":"coverall","id":415},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"45","block":"false","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":418},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bottlecollide","volume":"1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"给你，你自己买的自己不喝吗？","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"啊，柳德米拉还没有......","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"你看看你，这都拿了多少瓶了！","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"嘿嘿，不好意思！","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......我就算了吧。","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳德米拉，大家伙都知道的。","id":425},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"倒也不是说完全不在意。说实话，我摘下你的面罩时......真的吓了一跳。","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"不过你是感染者，你只会比我们更在意会不会影响到别人。","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你也别怪罗米他们几个老是缠着你问东问西的，他们没恶意，就是想多了解你一些。","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"别把我们当外人，柳德米拉。","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":433},{"type":"text","text":"夕阳染红了营地的草坪，以及司机们的脸。索默尔靠在后车厢，向她伸出手，其他的司机也都看着她，脸上带着毫无戒备的微笑。","id":434},{"type":"text","text":"可能是盐汽水也醉人吧，眉头深锁的瑞柏巴这样想。","id":435},{"type":"text","text":"短暂的沉默后，她摘下面罩，接过了那瓶盐汽水。","id":436},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"charslot","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":440},{"type":"image","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":444},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"好了，时间也差不多了，收拾一下，开车去法院广场吧。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"伊雷妮千叮咛万嘱咐，片场的时间安排比咱们出车排班更严格，千万不能迟到，给市政厅添麻烦。","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮人呢？","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"说是去找拉维妮娅法官谈新司机资质审核的事情。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"哦......","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"对了索默尔，你真不跟我们一起吗？","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"就是开着卡车配合他们搞点大场面就行，很简单的，而且市政厅给的报酬可比咱们开一天车要高。","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我、我最近出车太多了，难得空下来，就在营地补觉了。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"柳德米拉，那你呢？","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我还有点事，也不去了。","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"好吧。那我们走了。","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":467},{"type":"dialog","id":468},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drivestop","id":469},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":470},{"type":"charslot","id":471},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"呼，总算......","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":477},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":478},{"type":"playsound","key":"$sportscarstart","id":479},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":480},{"type":"text","text":"一队队的卡车已经从营地开走，夜色慢慢降下来了，四下无人，索默尔找到了自己的车。","id":481},{"type":"text","text":"他发动了车子，可还没来得及关紧车门，一个身影就已经坐在了副驾驶座上，甚至连安全带都已经系好。","id":482},{"type":"dialog","id":483},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":484},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":488},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":489,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳、柳德米拉——","id":491,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你不是要睡觉吗？","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我......","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"开夜车，副驾驶座上怎么能没人呢？","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳德米拉，我其实......","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不是你说的吗——别把我当外人，索默尔。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":503},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":504},{"type":"curtain","id":505},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":506},{"type":"image","id":507},{"type":"charslot","id":508}],"characters":["？？？","索默尔","柳德米拉","穿红色连帽衫的人","红","外婆","狂欢节路人A","狂欢节路人B","狂欢节路人A＆B","大帝","子月","卡车司机A","卡车司机B"]}